[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5781.669, "timestamp": "01:36:21", "text": "要点です。 どこに行くの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5792.87, "timestamp": "01:36:32", "text": "誰でも撃ちます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5794.79, "timestamp": "01:36:34", "text": "いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5796.87, "timestamp": "01:36:36", "text": "なぜ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5800.47, "timestamp": "01:36:40", "text": "待って、私は人を撃っているけど、彼らが何をしているのかわから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5801.51, "timestamp": "01:36:41", "text": "ない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5803.669, "timestamp": "01:36:43", "text": "私は文字通り、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5806.709, "timestamp": "01:36:46", "text": "あなたの目の前で、まるで一発撃ったかのように4つ作りました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5809.109, "timestamp": "01:36:49", "text": "O."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5811.59, "timestamp": "01:36:51", "text": "なぜ撮影できないのでしょうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5815.75, "timestamp": "01:36:55", "text": "スタン状態になったね。 手持ちの武器を駆使せよ。 なんてこった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5817.189, "timestamp": "01:36:57", "text": "うん。   何てことだ"}]